senses.gloss:
रिह् (Vedic form of √ लिह्) cl. 6. 2. P. रिह॑ति, रे॑ढि (or रे॑ळ्हि; 3. pl. Ā. रिहते॑; pr. p. रिहाण॑ or रि॑हाण),
to lick, kiss, caress, RV.; AV.; VS.;
 (रिहति) to praise, worship, Naigh. iii, 14;
 (Imp. रिरिड्ढि, रिरीहि) to ask, implore, ib. iii, 19;
 also v.l. for √ रिफ्, Dhātup. xxviii, 23 :
Intens. रेरिह्य॑ते (रे॑रिहत्, ˚हाण See s.v.), to lick or kiss again and again, caress repeatedly, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.
